DATA='Kinetic energy|K=m*v^2/2|K,m,v|0+s|K>=0; velocity sign cannot follow from K alone.|P:2,-m*v^2;P:-v^2,2*K;P:-m,0,2*K\nConstant-force work|W=F*d*cos(th)|W,F,d,th|ssss|th between force and displacement; radians.|P:1,-F*d*cos(th);P:-d*cos(th),W;P:-F*cos(th),W;E:\nWork-energy|W=Kf-Ki|W,Kf,Ki|s00|W is total net work.|P:1,-Kf + Ki;P:-1,Ki + W;P:1,-Kf + W\nHeight potential|U=m*g*h|U,m,h|s+s|Near Earth; chosen zero; g=9.8.|P:1,-g*h*m;P:-g*h,U;P:-g*m,U\nSpring energy|U=ks*x^2/2|U,ks,x|s+s|x from unstretched length; energy>=0.|P:2,-ks*x^2;P:-x^2,2*U;P:-ks,0,2*U\nGravity potential|U=-G*M*m/r|U,M,m,r|s+++|Zero at infinity; point/spherical source.|P:r,G*M*m;P:G*m,U*r;P:G*M,U*r;P:U,G*M*m\nEnergy balance|Kf+Uf=Ki+Ui+W|Kf,Uf,Ki,Ui,W|0s0ss|W is external/nonconservative work.|P:1,-Ki + Uf - Ui - W;P:1,Kf - Ki - Ui - W;P:-1,Kf + Uf - Ui - W;P:-1,Kf - Ki + Uf - W;P:-1,Kf - Ki + Uf - Ui\nAverage power|P=W/t|P,W,t|ss0|t>0; work over this interval.|P:t,-W;P:-1,P*t;P:P,-W\nInstant force power|P=F*v*cos(th)|P,F,v,th|ssss|th between vectors; radians.|P:1,-F*v*cos(th);P:-v*cos(th),P;P:-F*cos(th),P;E:\nEscape speed|v^2=2*G*M/r|v,M,r|s++|Neglect drag; zero final speed at infinity.|P:r,0,-2*G*M;P:-2*G,r*v^2;P:v^2,-2*G*M\nCircular orbit energy|E=-G*M*m/(2*r)|E,M,m,r|s+++|Total K+U for circular orbit.|P:2*r,G*M*m;P:G*m,2*E*r;P:G*M,2*E*r;P:2*E,G*M*m'
